{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "comment": [
      "The thing that actually makes the agent run on a timer.",
      "",
      "Foundry routines look like the native answer and are declared in",
      "azure.yaml, but they do not fire: registered routines produced no runs",
      "over six days, and Application Insights showed agent activity only in the",
      "hours containing a manual invocation. Both routines therefore ship",
      "disabled, and this is the trigger the accelerator actually supports.",
      "docs/hosted-architecture.md records the evidence and the commands to",
      "reproduce it.",
      "",
      "Deploy it twice with different parameters - once for the mailbox drain",
      "and once for the silent-failure scan - because they are different jobs on",
      "different cadences:",
      "",
      "  command='sweep'         every 5 minutes   drains the mailbox and runs",
      "                                            deferred retries",
      "  command='silent sweep'  hourly            runs the freshness, volume",
      "                                            and schema probes, which no",
      "                                            alert will ever tell you about",
      "",
      "Why a Logic App and not a Function or a VM cron: it authenticates with a",
      "system-assigned managed identity, so there is no key anywhere, which the",
      "tenant requires. It also keeps its own run history, so a failed sweep is",
      "visible after the fact rather than being a thing that quietly stopped.",
      "",
      "The identity needs permission to invoke the agent. That grant is not in",
      "this template because it is a role assignment on the Foundry project,",
      "which is a different scope - see docs/provisioning.md."
    ]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "bi-triage-scheduled-sweep",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Deploy this template once per cadence, with a distinct name each time."
      }
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "[resourceGroup().location]"
    },
    "projectEndpoint": {
      "type": "string",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "e.g. https://<account>.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/<project>"
      }
    },
    "agentName": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "bi-triage-controller"
    },
    "command": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "sweep",
      "allowedValues": [
        "sweep",
        "silent sweep"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Constrained on purpose. The controller routes anything it does not recognise to 'triage this text as an alert', so a typo here would not fail - it would quietly triage the word as if it were a Power BI alert."
      }
    },
    "frequency": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "Minute",
      "allowedValues": [
        "Minute",
        "Hour",
        "Day"
      ]
    },
    "interval": {
      "type": "int",
      "defaultValue": 5
    },
    "alertWebhookUrl": {
      "type": "securestring",
      "defaultValue": "",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Optional Teams incoming webhook. If set, a failed sweep posts here. Leave empty and failures are still visible in run history, but nothing announces them - which is how an outage went unnoticed until someone invoked the agent by hand."
      }
    },
    "owner": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "unassigned",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only. Set it to whoever should be asked before this is deleted."
      }
    }
  },
  "variables": {
    "agentUri": "[concat(parameters('projectEndpoint'), '/agents/', parameters('agentName'), '/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses?api-version=v1')]",
    "foundryAudience": "https://ai.azure.com"
  },
  "resources": [
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Logic/workflows",
      "apiVersion": "2019-05-01",
      "name": "[parameters('name')]",
      "location": "[parameters('location')]",
      "identity": {
        "type": "SystemAssigned"
      },
      "tags": {
        "CostCenter": "demo",
        "Owner": "[parameters('owner')]",
        "Environment": "demo",
        "DataClassification": "synthetic"
      },
      "properties": {
        "state": "Enabled",
        "definition": {
          "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
          "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
          "parameters": {
            "agentUri": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('agentUri')]"
            },
            "foundryAudience": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('foundryAudience')]"
            },
            "command": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[parameters('command')]"
            },
            "alertWebhookUrl": {
              "type": "SecureString",
              "defaultValue": "[parameters('alertWebhookUrl')]"
            }
          },
          "triggers": {
            "Every_interval": {
              "type": "Recurrence",
              "recurrence": {
                "frequency": "[parameters('frequency')]",
                "interval": "[parameters('interval')]"
              }
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Invoke_the_agent": {
              "type": "Http",
              "runAfter": {},
              "inputs": {
                "method": "POST",
                "uri": "@parameters('agentUri')",
                "headers": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json"
                },
                "body": {
                  "input": "@{parameters('command')}"
                },
                "authentication": {
                  "type": "ManagedServiceIdentity",
                  "audience": "@parameters('foundryAudience')"
                },
                "retryPolicy": {
                  "type": "none"
                }
              },
              "limit": {
                "timeout": "PT3M"
              }
            },
            "Did_it_fail": {
              "type": "If",
              "runAfter": {
                "Invoke_the_agent": [
                  "Failed",
                  "TimedOut"
                ]
              },
              "expression": {
                "and": [
                  {
                    "not": {
                      "equals": [
                        "@empty(parameters('alertWebhookUrl'))",
                        true
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "actions": {
                "Announce_the_failure": {
                  "type": "Http",
                  "runAfter": {},
                  "inputs": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "uri": "@parameters('alertWebhookUrl')",
                    "headers": {
                      "Content-Type": "application/json"
                    },
                    "body": {
                      "type": "message",
                      "attachments": [
                        {
                          "contentType": "application/vnd.microsoft.card.adaptive",
                          "content": {
                            "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
                            "type": "AdaptiveCard",
                            "version": "1.4",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "type": "TextBlock",
                                "size": "Medium",
                                "weight": "Bolder",
                                "color": "Attention",
                                "text": "Scheduled sweep failed"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "TextBlock",
                                "wrap": true,
                                "text": "The agent did not answer. Nothing was triaged on this run."
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "FactSet",
                                "facts": [
                                  {
                                    "title": "Schedule",
                                    "value": "@{workflow()['name']}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "Command",
                                    "value": "@{parameters('command')}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "Status",
                                    "value": "@{outputs('Invoke_the_agent')?['statusCode']}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "When",
                                    "value": "@{utcNow()}"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "else": {
                "actions": {}
              }
            },
            "Fail_the_run": {
              "type": "Terminate",
              "runAfter": {
                "Did_it_fail": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "runStatus": "Failed",
                "runError": {
                  "code": "SweepFailed",
                  "message": "The agent did not answer. Handling the failure must not mark the run successful, or the run history stops being evidence."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "outputs": {}
        },
        "parameters": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "principalId": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "[reference(resourceId('Microsoft.Logic/workflows', parameters('name')), '2019-05-01', 'full').identity.principalId]"
    }
  }
}
